     4613       end.
     4614     end case.
     4615   End.
     4616   END PROCEDURE.
     4617   PROCEDURE state-changed :
     4618     DEFINE INPUT PARAMETER p-issuer-hdl AS HANDLE    NO-UNDO.
     4619     DEFINE INPUT PARAMETER p-state      AS CHARACTER NO-UNDO.
     4620     CASE p-state:
     4621       when "link-changed":U then  DO:
     4622            run my-var in this-procedure .
     4623            End.
     4624     END CASE.
     4625   END PROCEDURE.
